riptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T22:35:42Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T22:35:42Z","body":"`bytes_to_var_with_objects` will for some reason embed resources instead of referencing them. Custom type resources have hidden `_custom_type_script` metadata, which gets duplicated. The same would happen if you export a variable of type Script.\n\nTo fix it there needs to be an exception, similar to #100177.\nThough a more comprehensive fix would be changing `_custom_type_script` to String. It would fix all duplication problems.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644252917/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652273633","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102551#issuecomment-2652273633","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102551","id":2652273633,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eFnvh","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use